<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
    <p class="ws-index ws-ink">01 · The defaults</p>
    <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="c1_title">No options at all.</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="c1_lead">A root, a track and its slides. Slides crossfade and loop, full-height arrows sit on each edge, the dots are generated, and a click anywhere on a slide moves it on. Swipe and the arrow keys work too. The height is set once, on the root.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-10">
<!--demo:defaults-->
<div class="relative h-[22rem] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl sm:h-[28rem]" data-sw-component="carousel" data-sw-block="Carousel" aria-label="Sitewright in four slides">
