    <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
      <p class="ws-index ws-ink">02 · Slide and autoplay</p>
      <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="c2_title">A moving strip that advances on its own.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="c2_lead"><code class="font-code text-base">data-effect="slide"</code> swaps the crossfade for a translating strip, and <code class="font-code text-base">data-autoplay</code> steps it every <code class="font-code text-base">data-interval</code> milliseconds. Hovering or focusing it pauses the timer, and visitors who prefer reduced motion get no autoplay at all.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start">
