<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
    <p class="ws-index ws-ink">03 · Several at once</p>
    <h2 class="ws-display mt-3 text-3xl font-bold sm:text-5xl" data-sw-text="c3_title">A row of cards with a peek.</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="c3_lead">The <code class="font-code text-base">--sw-items</code> variable sets how many slides fit the row. A fraction leaves the next card peeking, and responsive classes change it per breakpoint. <code class="font-code text-base">data-item-align="center"</code> centres the active card. Multi-item rows get compact round arrows. The cards here are this showcase's own pages, looped from the page tree.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-10">
<!--demo:peek-->
<div class="relative [--sw-items:1.15] md:[--sw-items:2.4] lg:[--sw-items:3.3]" data-sw-component="carousel" data-sw-block="Carousel" data-effect="slide" data-item-align="center" aria-label="Showcase pages">
